# DRAW keymap preset: Adobe Illustrator (default keyboard shortcuts; Mac Cmd = Ctrl)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt. forbidMods 0 = every modifier the row does not require
#   (Shift stays allowed on printable non-letters like > { + _ , typed with it).
#   A row that must leave Shift+key alone (Ctrl+] vs Ctrl+Shift+]) writes forbidMods 6.
#   Ctrl+Shift+punctuation is the UNshifted key with Ctrl+Shift: Ctrl+Shift+' = 39 3 (not 34).
#   Keycodes: letters are lowercase ASCII (Shift+letter = the letter, requireMods 2);
#   Tab 9, Backspace 8, Enter 13, Insert 20992, Delete 21248, F1 15104 ... F10 17408,
#   F11 34048, F12 34304. Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# How a keymap applies (CFG/BINDINGS.BM BINDINGS_apply):
#   - an action's Nth row moves its Nth key; a row past the keys it has ADDS one
#   - a DRAW key a row takes is unbound (that DRAW action loses the key)
#   - keys no row takes keep their DRAW meaning
# Mac apps: Cmd is Ctrl here, Option is Alt.
# Illustrator is a vector app: DRAW has no direct-selection, anchor, artboard, blend or
#   width tools, so those keys stay with DRAW. Rows map the tools that have a pixel match.
# Already the same in DRAW (no row): V selection (Move), B paintbrush, T type, I eyedropper,
#   Z zoom, X swap fill / stroke, Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Shift+Z, Ctrl+G group, Ctrl+Shift+] / [
#   bring to front / send to back, Ctrl+A select all, Ctrl+= / Ctrl+- zoom, Ctrl+N / O / S.
# Not in DRAW (no row): A direct selection, N pencil, Shift+M shape builder, G gradient,
#   H hand (DRAW: hold Space), W blend, C scissors, Shift+O artboard, Ctrl+D transform again,
#   Ctrl+F / Ctrl+B paste in front / back, Ctrl+2 / 3 lock / hide, Ctrl+Y outline
#   (stays Redo), Ctrl+R rulers (stays Reference Image), Ctrl+J join, Ctrl+8 compound path.
# DRAW keys this preset takes: M marquee (Illustrator: rectangle), L line (ellipse),
#   C ellipse (moves to L), W wand (moves to Y), Q bezier (moves to P; Q = lasso),
#   E eraser (moves to Shift+E), P polygon, R rectangle (R = rotate), O bevel, K spray,
#   H flip (moves to O), \ brush shape, Ctrl+D deselect (moves to Ctrl+Shift+A), Tab
#   toolbar, F6 pixel perfect, F7 symmetry, Ctrl+Shift+V OS paste.

# --- Tools ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
122 112 0 0     # P        pen                    -> Bezier
105 92 0 0      # \        line segment           -> Line
108 109 0 0     # M        rectangle
110 108 0 0     # L        ellipse
118 101 2 0     # Shift+E  eraser
325 101 0 0     # E        free transform         -> Transform: Scale
325 115 0 0     # S        scale
328 114 0 0     # R        rotate                 -> Transform: Rotate
315 111 0 0     # O        reflect                -> Flip Horizontal
103 107 0 0     # K        live paint bucket      -> Fill
119 113 0 0     # Q        lasso                  -> Freehand Select
117 121 0 0     # Y        magic wand
518 100 0 0     # D        default fill / stroke  -> Default Colors

# --- Object / select ---------------------------------------------------------------------
722 103 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+G  ungroup
703 93 1 6      # Ctrl+]        bring forward      -> Move Layer Up
704 91 1 6      # Ctrl+[        send backward      -> Move Layer Down
307 97 3 0      # Ctrl+Shift+A  deselect
312 118 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+V  paste in place

# --- View / panels ----------------------------------------------------------------------
405 48 1 0      # Ctrl+0        (DRAW's own key, kept)
405 49 1 0      # Ctrl+1        actual size        -> Reset Zoom
8101 39 0 0     # '             (DRAW's grid key, kept)
8101 39 1 6     # Ctrl+"  (the ' key)  show grid
8104 39 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+"  snap to grid
403 34048 0 0   # F11           (DRAW's own key, kept)
403 9 0 0       # Tab           hide panels        -> Toggle All UI
437 9 2 0       # Shift+Tab     hide panels, keep tools -> Hide/Show Right Side UI
453 102 0 0     # F             screen modes       -> Toggle Fullscreen
404 108 1 0     # Ctrl+L        (DRAW's own key, kept)
404 16640 0 0   # F7            layers panel
2021 16384 0 0  # F6            colour panel       -> Color Mixer
2100 107 1 0    # Ctrl+K        preferences        -> Settings
2360 107 7 0    # Ctrl+Alt+Shift+K  keyboard shortcuts -> Customize Controls
